@startuml
' ASII-15 - Semana 2
' Infraestructura de red y servidores propuesta para el HIS.

title ASII-15 - Infraestructura de red y servidores

left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

cloud "Internet / Red institucional" as Internet

node "DMZ / Red publica\n10.10.10.0/24" as DMZ {
  node "Reverse Proxy / Firewall\nNginx + TLS" as Proxy
}

node "Red de Aplicacion\n10.10.20.0/24" as APPNET {
  node "Servidor de aplicacion\nLaravel + Vue + PHP-FPM" as App
  node "Redis\nCache / Queue" as Redis
}

node "Red de Datos\n10.10.30.0/24" as DATANET {
  database "Base de datos\nMySQL o PostgreSQL" as DB
  node "Repositorio de backups" as Backup
}

node "Red de Administracion\n10.10.40.0/24" as MGMT {
  node "VPN / Bastion" as Bastion
  node "Monitoreo y logs" as Monitor
}

Internet --> Proxy : HTTPS 443
Proxy --> App : Trafico interno 8080/9000
App --> DB : 3306/5432
App --> Redis : 6379
App --> Backup : dumps / snapshots
Bastion --> Proxy : Admin
Bastion --> App : Admin
Bastion --> DB : Admin
Monitor ..> App : metricas
Monitor ..> DB : metricas
Monitor ..> Proxy : metricas

note bottom
  Para una version minima, proxy y aplicacion pueden
  convivir en una misma VM. La base de datos debe
  mantenerse separada en red privada.
end note

@enduml
